### GET Books

GET {{base_url}}/books/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json


### GET Book

GET {{base_url}}/books/aadu-jeevitham-1/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json


### POST Books

POST {{base_url}}/books/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aadu jeevitham",
  "price": 2000
}


### PATCH Book

PATCH {{base_url}}/books/aadu-jeevitham/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_active": false,
  "price": 100
}


### DELETE Book

DELETE {{base_url}}/books/aadu-jeevitham/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
